		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Wingless sky dragon, twined into serpentine knots. Live in mythical sky castles.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 17, <strong>HP</strong> 72, <strong>ATK</strong> 4 rend +8 (2d8) or 1 ice breath, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> -1, <strong>C</strong> +5, <strong>I</strong> +4, <strong>W</strong> +4, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 15</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Ice Breath</strong>. Fills a double near-sized cube extending from dragon. DEX 15+ or 4d8 damage and frozen for 1 round.</p><p></p><p><strong>Imperious</strong>. Only damaged by magical sources. Transform into pheasant, shellfish, or songbird.</p><p></p><p><strong>Pearl Soul</strong>. If reduced to 0 HP, transforms into fist-sized, perfect pearl for 77 years.</p><p></p><p><strong>Wind Form</strong>. Turn into cloud.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
